Files under the Apache License 2.0

These files hold code and data of Espressif Systems (Shanghai) Co.,
Ltd. The MIT License above does not cover them. They are under the
Apache License 2.0; its text is in blob/esp32/LICENSE.

- blob/esp32/libphy, blob/esp32/libpp, blob/esp32/librtc: the libraries
  libphy.a, libpp.a and librtc.a of Espressif for the ESP32, and the
  files made from them (.S, .fs).
- lib/esp32/esp32/phychip.fs, phyana.fs, phycal.fs, phyrtc.fs and
  phydata.fs: functions and data of these libraries, copied by
  tools/pick.fs. The head of each file says where they come from and
  what was changed.
- INIT-DATA in lib/esp32/esp32/phy.fs: 128 bytes of parameters of the
  radio from ESP-IDF (phy_init_data.c). The rest of that file is under
  the MIT License.
